---
/**
 * @file SilenceMoment.astro
 * @description One quiet beat between Vox memoriae (II) and the catalog of past concerts.
 *  The word is the moment: in a part-book, tacet instructs the voice to stay silent — here
 *  the page rests before the voice enters (VoxMoment follows). No attribution, no aphorism.
 *
 *  The pacing is spatial, NOT behavioural: the section's own height and the ornament's reveal
 *  supply the pause. The page never touches the visitor's scroll — an earlier version halted
 *  Lenis for ~2.8s and read as a frozen page on touch, so the lock was removed (see the note
 *  over setupSilenceMoment in scripts/landing.ts, which now only marks the section settled).
 *  Reduced-motion + no-JS visitors see the line statically (gated by html.voct-motion).
 * @architecture Astro islands 2026
 * @module components/landing/SilenceMoment
 */
---

<section class="silence-moment" data-silence aria-label="Chwila ciszy">
  <div class="silence-sentinel" data-silence-sentinel aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="silence-inner">
    <svg
      class="silence-ornament"
      viewBox="0 0 120 12"
      fill="none"
      stroke="currentColor"
      stroke-linecap="round"
      aria-hidden="true"
    >
      <line x1="0" y1="6" x2="50" y2="6" stroke-width="0.5" stroke-opacity="0.45" />
      <circle cx="60" cy="6" r="1.6" fill="currentColor" stroke="none" />
      <line x1="70" y1="6" x2="120" y2="6" stroke-width="0.5" stroke-opacity="0.45" />
    </svg>

    <p class="silence-line">
      <em>tacet.</em>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
